{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31754","headline":"寄友人 · 贾岛","name":"寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同人半年别，一别寂来音。\n赖有别时文，相思时一吟。\n我常倦投迹，君亦知此衿。\n笔砚且勿弃，苏张曾陆沈。\n但存舌在口，当冀身遂心。\n君看明月夜，松桂寒森森。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}